Comment: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:09.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The konpeito... are accumulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.86,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's wish has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:23.17,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But the contract cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:26.68,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,The contract to reach the place she wished to go to... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:31.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's just like a curse now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:40.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I must go to the place I should be at.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.20,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you guys all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.11,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:19.98,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Mama told us to come clean up the futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:20.81,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Futon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:25.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why was there a futon in an unoccupied room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:28.75,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:31.44,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto carried it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:35.00,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu, is your arm okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:38.27,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's already been a month after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.61,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.77,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:46.12,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I was thinking of searching for a new tenant... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:50.23,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,That room's been empty since \Nbefore Fujimoto got here and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.78,0:03:53.07,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Without a tenant, even a room can get empty, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:54.64,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:04:02.82,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose, I'll air out that room every once in a while, so do you think we could keep it unoccupied for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:04.64,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:08.03,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:10.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.17,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I just said something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:21.03,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:21.94,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:25.86,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is it true that you didn't go to the professor's seminar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.03,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:30.01,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to be a lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:35.75,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard that lately you haven't even been taking notes anymore. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.47,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're kind of off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:44.02,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's like you've lost your drive or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:50.80,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you did lose something really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.39,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's already been three months since it happened... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.98,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:03.68,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... I wasn't really that worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:05.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:16.03,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Just?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:18.98,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nevermind...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:29.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:51.23,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that the children were \Nworried about Yomogi Nursery...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.54,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So we all came to see it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:57.93,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Fujimoto... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:03.93,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking of trying to start up Yomogi Nursery again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:11.26,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura said that this time, he'd do everything he could to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:14.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's great. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You do your best too, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:24.86,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that you've been kind of down at school lately. I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it, Domoto... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:33.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Once everything's set up again, let's all go on an outing together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:36.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, let's all go... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:38.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:45.16,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.96,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yay, outing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.48,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.02,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.46,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:54.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. We'll all go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:56.30,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:58.84,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:01.51,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Yay, all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:51.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a bully...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:55.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.84,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.07,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:10.10,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:15.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why doesn't anyone remember her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:30.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:33.74,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:43.39,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't look like you're here to deliver the paper this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:49.65,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I remember her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:54.56,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't a single person who remembers her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And yet, you do. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:02.14,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really what you want to ask about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.51,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Is there not something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:09.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:16.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,When she disappeared, she said that she had to go to the place she should to be at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.49,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:26.95,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,If you really want to know the truth, then please, somehow calmly listen to what I am about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.71,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:45.57,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,A long time ago, because of another unfortunate incident with the human world, that girl lost her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Her life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:52.56,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:59.27,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,...was to be reborn across time at the side of the person she loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:03.78,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,That was her wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:10.78,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And in order to make it come true, she was put to the test... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:14.22,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,and permitted to come down to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:20.98,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,She was granted only four seasons, and came with just a temporary soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:25.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then she's now... already at that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.24,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,That I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:38.21,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Throughout the long, long months and years, Shuichiro and I have had many sad partings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:41.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is Shuichiro that doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:42.34,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:46.77,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But you see, every time Shuichiro is reborn... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:52.50,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, every time he is reborn, our hearts are called together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:54.56,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,and we cross each other's paths once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:58.82,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we've lost all memory of our previous lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.56,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It's because we share the same soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:11.02,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,With our souls as one, we will be called together again and again, as long as time continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:13.00,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Of that, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:41.23,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,At that rate, who knows what would've happen if the factory's machines were impounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:43.67,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,But everything's okay thanks to you, Mr. Fukita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:45.16,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad things worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.09,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:48.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.97,0:12:51.88,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:53.02,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:57.07,Default,Fujita,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to do this now, but make sure you take a look at the file on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:13:00.70,Default,Fujita,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going away for a bit and there's \Nsomething I want you to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:02.01,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.48,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It's supposedly about property inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:06.14,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Fukita, who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:09.06,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is this your first time seeing him, Mr. Yamaguchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:13.38,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,It's been just about four years since he came to work at my firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:17.22,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Fukita Law Firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:18.56,Default Alt,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,Even though he's still young, he's very on top of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:22.17,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, it's the courthouse clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:22.97,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:29.67,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,It's about the client who passed away a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:37.19,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,Two years ago, because both his son and daughter-in-law had died,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:39.87,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,he revised his will to allow his grandchild to be his inheritor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:44.69,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,But regarding the real estate, \Nbecause his family is an old one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:48.27,Default,Fukita,0000,0000,0000,,the boundaries on their grounds have become rather obscure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:50.16,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:52.87,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I will go there and take a look at the area tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:18.47,Default,Kobato?!,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...flowers that bloom in springtime,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:24.72,Default,Kobato?!,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}the endless skies of summer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:28.39,Default,Kobato?!,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}are both brilliantly...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.87,Default,Kobato?!,0000,0000,0000,,So you're from the law firm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:35.81,Default,Kobato?!,0000,0000,0000,,It's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:41.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's very nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:48.04,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we've lost all memory of our previous lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:52.17,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:59.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're my most important person, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Up until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:06.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,From now on... till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:09.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The piano...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:14.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're very good at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.94,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for playing it without asking first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:21.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know why, but somehow I know that song as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:25.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:28.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Someone important to me sang that song for me in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:32.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,and I've always, always been looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:35.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:37.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you'll be able to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:41.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:46.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then, would it be all right for me to check the inside of your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:48.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.38,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:58.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll return to the office now and start the proceedings for succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And also, I need to return this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:06.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Konpeito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:16.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And lastly... could you sing that song for me one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:19.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:41.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The flowers that bloom in springtime,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:48.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}the endless skies of summer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:20:01.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}are both brilliantly engraved into my heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:15.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when it rains and the windows are closed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:27.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}the overflowing light from my heart shines from...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:48.29,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:56.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:02.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The place I wanted to go to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:07.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The place where the person I \Nwanted to be with most was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:13.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I were able to meet that person once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:17.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,this time, I wanted to make sure I could greet him with a smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:22.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... it really is impossible for me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:24.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:29.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.89,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You've made me wait for so many years...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:36.99,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're terribly late, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:43.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:54.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Happiness or sadness,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:22:01.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll embrace all of it and continue walking forward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:08.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They are what so strongly connect... {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:15.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...my hands to yours.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:40.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Fall is by the waterfront, winter is hidden in the tips of branches.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.24,0:22:53.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There is limitless kindness in the depth of the world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.28,0:23:07.47,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\i1}Each time night falls, let us offer up a prayer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:20.24,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\i1}That we can welcome each coming day with peace.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:58.48,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, even though that idiot fulfilled his mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:02.94,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,because he said he wanted to watch over that girl from the shadows and decided to stay in the human world,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:07.83,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,we have no choice but to stay here and just grumble over our baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:08.82,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.99,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Baumkuchen is delicious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.52,0:23:15.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:19.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A full 100 points to the mighty Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:34.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Guide me, O voice, so far, far away.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:38.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like smiles...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:41.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like songs...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.59,0:23:47.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The resonating sound of the wind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.82,0:23:54.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Happiness or sadness,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.34,0:24:00.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll embrace all of it and continue walking forward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.92,0:24:07.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They are what so strongly connect...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.77,0:24:14.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...my hands to yours.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:26.76,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:34.43,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.20,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:38.21,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:41.01,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:48.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:53.93,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.77,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:02:01.31,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:04.37,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:07.11,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:12.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:15.17,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:18.76,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:21.52,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:24.26,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:31.14,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:35.15,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:39.80,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
